ipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/coverage_global_pipeline.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/coverage_player_core.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/coverage_run_lifecycle.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/coverage_world_foundations.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/evidence_enemy_encounters.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/evidence_player_combat_doors.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/execution_scope.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/structure_dependencies.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/pass2/structure_resources.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/refined_candidate.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/refined_candidate.raw.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/stream_conflicts/cluster_01/ARBITRATED_FIELD_REPAIR.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/stream_conflicts/cluster_01/CLUSTER_INPUT.json\nPipeline/Reconciliation/outputs/runs/20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5/verifications/20260821T195959Z-43dba5de/stream_repairs/coverage_content_encounters/RECOVERED_FIELD_REPAIR.json\nPipeline/Re