3be511c 2026-08-21 Use resumable Codex review with max final reasoning\n330c63d 2026-08-21 Add architecture review resume smoke test\nf14d0c0 2026-08-21 Ignore generated architecture review outputs\n3c8667a 2026-08-21 Update Codex smoke test for resumable max-reasoning flow\n4af1f4e 2026-08-21 Document resumable Codex architecture review flow\n17e01ae 2026-08-21 Add Phase 1 task execution authority guard\n28fb7cd 2026-08-21 Add task-contract schema v2 migration tooling\ncba39b7 2026-08-21 Add task-contract quality audit\n138919b 2026-08-21 Refine schema v2 migration after quality audit\n7240128 2026-08-21 Test reviewed schema v2 migration corrections\na943ab7 2026-08-21 Document reviewed schema v2 migration corrections\n932f2ef 2026-08-21 Record schema v2 contract quality decisions\ndcee7b7 2026-08-21 Correct reviewed migration finding count\n473af84 2026-08-21 Migrate task contracts to reviewed schema v2\n8a82d1b 2026-08-21 Preserve final adversarial architecture review evidence\n3386440 2026-08-21 Extracts the deterministic Assignment 4 retrieval approach into a standalone production GDD RAG subsystem backed by the current canonical Markdown GDD.\n9b5344c 2026-08-21 Harden production GDD RAG integrity validation\n6fdfe22 2026-08-21 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/adversarial-architecture-review' into task-contract-schema-v2\naa85c73 2026-08-21 Scope migration overrides to approved bootstrap provenance\nd0d95af 2026-08-21 Update pipeline current state after architecture correction\n53a1b86 2026-08-21 Normalize migration report hashes across line endings\nbcef7ba 2026-08-22 Add evidence-derived current conformance evaluator\nea41860 2026-08-22 Support baseline conformance evidence\n4666b0c 2026-08-22 Plan provider-neutral execution crew architecture\na3b0069 2026-08-22 Accept provider-neutral agent runtime architecture\n1d4c230 2026-08-22 Add repository-wide Unity testing safety policy\n1d3ed42 2026-08-22 Wait for Unity test process and result publication\n0d39