tionController.BeginInteraction() gates on IsInRange/IsOpen before calling StartInteraction. Covered by Completion_OpensDoor_AfterFullDuration test (DoorInteractionPlayModeTests.cs:37-47).\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"AC-2\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"DoorInteractable.Progress is a public get-only float (DoorInteractable.cs:15) updated monotonically in Tick(). Progress_IsApproximatelyHalf_AtHalfDuration test asserts ~0.5 at half duration. Note: contract's acceptance_criteria text for AC-2 describes checking ~0.4 at 2s, while the contract's own test_cases section describes checking ~0.5 at 2.5s (half duration) — these two contract sections are mutually inconsistent; the implementer followed the test_cases version. This is a contract authoring inconsistency, not an implementation defect, and does not block AC-2's substantive requirement (monotonic normalized progress).\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"AC-3\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"PlayerInteractionController.EndInteraction() calls CurrentDoor.CancelInteraction(), which sets IsInteracting=false and Progress=0f exactly. Covered by ReleasingInteraction_CancelsAttempt test.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"AC-4\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"PlayerInteractionController.OnPlayerMoved() calls EndInteraction() when IsInteracting. Cover\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"role\": \"Submission Packaging Agent\",\r\n      \"prompt\": \"AgentCrew/prompts/04_packager.md\",\r\n      \"started_at_utc\": \"2026-08-05T00:01:10.293256+00:00\",\r\n      \"finished_at_utc\": \"2026-08-05T00:02:51.194410+00:00\",\r\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\r\n      \"duration_seconds\": 100.9,\r\n      \"session_id\": \"bea1a056-7e28-4a08-928d-c6eaf4e29f18\",\r\n      \"num_turns\": 22,\r\n      \"result_excerpt\": \"All four required outputs are complete since the validation gate passed (`status: \\\"pass\\\"`, zero blocking issues):\\n\\n- **`README.md`** — game/assignment overview, agent roles table with 