authoritative Assets/Scenes/DoorPrototype.unity fixed orthographic isometric camera.\"\r\n    76\t    },\r\n    77\t    {\r\n    78\t      \"gate_id\": \"VAL-002\",\r\n    79\t      \"result\": \"pass\",\r\n    80\t      \"evidence\": [\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
