{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"git show --stat --summary 96dc7be && git show --format=fuller --no-ext-diff 96dc7be -- Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests.cs | sed -n '1,320p'; git show --stat --summary 1d3ed42 && git show --stat --summary 1d4c230\"","aggregated_output":"commit 96dc7be31f90fe0ae80b43d2ef71519e8a9e1725\nAuthor:     cathode26 <Vincent.J.Liguori@outlook.com>\nAuthorDate: Sat Aug 22 12:22:03 2026 -0500\nCommit:     cathode26 <Vincent.J.Liguori@outlook.com>\nCommitDate: Sat Aug 22 12:22:03 2026 -0500\n\n    Make camera validation tests non-destructive\n    \n    Separate in-memory scene-builder tests from committed-scene camera conformance tests. Preserve the production scene-building command while preventing normal EditMode tests from opening or saving the canonical DoorPrototype scene. Add byte-preservation regressions and scene-scoped NSC-023 camera gate tests.\n\ndiff --git a/Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests.cs b/Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests.cs\nindex e4e9b76..0b23538 100644\n--- a/Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests.cs\n+++ b/Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/Editor/DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests.cs\n@@ -1,7 +1,9 @@\n+using System.IO;\n using System.Reflection;\n using NUnit.Framework;\n using NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Editor;\n using UnityEditor;\n+using UnityEditor.SceneManagement;\n using UnityEngine;\n using UnityEngine.InputSystem;\n using UnityEngine.TestTools;\n@@ -11,10 +13,25 @@ namespace NoSafeCircle.DoorPrototype.Tests.Editor\n {\n     public class DoorPrototypeSceneBuilderTests\n     {\n+        private const string CanonicalScenePath =\n+            \"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scenes/DoorPrototype.unity\";\n+\n+        [SetUp]\n+        public void SetUp()\n+        {\n+        